      "title": "Consider adding a Canada-specific student/product jobs companion resource",
      "description": "Hi Jobright team — thanks for maintaining this Product Management internship tracker.\n\nWould you consider adding a small Canada-specific companion resource link for students who use this repo but want more Canadian student/new-grad coverage?\n\nSuggested link:\n\n```md\n- [Hanzilla Jobs – Canadian business, product-adjacent, and student jobs](https://jobs.hanzilla.co/business/) — free daily-updated Canadian student/recent-grad board covering business, product-adjacent, analyst, finance, engineering, tech, internships/co-ops, new-grad, junior, and entry-level roles. Internship-focused page: https://jobs.hanzilla.co/internships/\n```\n\nWhy it seems relevant here:\n\n- this repo already surfaces Canada-relevant product/product-strategy roles such as Toronto/Oakville listings;\n- Hanzilla is Canada-specific and aimed at university students/recent grads, so it complements a broader global/Product Management tracker rather than replacing it;\n- the board is not CS-only: it includes business, finance, engineering, sciences, tech, internships/co-ops, new-grad, junior, and entry-level roles.\n\nFor trust/context, the project about/verification page is here: https://jobs.hanzilla.co/about/\n\nNo worries if external companion links are out of scope — just wanted to suggest it for Canadian students landing here from search.",
